{
  "_comment": "V6 探针：格式工具只许改用户要求的那一项。outcomeCheck 读 ctx.calls（原生工具调用参数），doc_set_paragraph_format / doc_format_selection 里任何非 null 且不在本句允许集、也不是定位参数的键都判失败（例如只要缩进却带了 headingLevel=0 会把标题打回正文）。",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "f1-indent",
      "text": "把第三条首行缩进2字符",
      "hostState": "docx:contract",
      "expect": {
        "mustUse": [
          [
            "doc_set_paragraph_format"
          ]
        ],
        "mustNotUse": [
          "write_docx",
          "move_to_trash"
        ],
        "maxRounds": 8,
        "outcomeCheck": "const A=new Set(['firstLineIndentChars','firstLineIndentPt']),L=new Set(['startParagraph','endParagraph','anchorId','anchorText']);const c=ctx.calls.filter(x=>['doc_set_paragraph_format','doc_format_selection'].includes(x.name));return c.length>0&&c.every(x=>x.args&&Object.entries(x.args).every(([k,v])=>v===null||A.has(k)||L.has(k)));"
      }
    },
    {
